    pearls: 'Rule of 10s: 10% extra-adrenal, 10% bilateral, 10% malignant, 10% paediatric, 10% familial. Alpha-blockade FIRST, then beta-blockade — never reverse. Phentolamine for acute hypertensive crises.',
    references: ['Lenders JW, et al. Pheochromocytoma and paraganglioma: Endocrine Society guideline. J Clin Endocrinol Metab. 2014', 'Kenya Endocrine Society Guidelines for Adrenal Tumors'],
