    carePlan: 'Start fludrocortisone and midodrine for postural hypotension. Start metoclopramide for gastroparesis (limited duration). Compression stockings. Dietary modifications. Refer to endocrinology for insulin optimisation. Refer to cardiology for tilt-table test if refractory.',
